### TalentBridge Post API — auth cycle
### Run top to bottom (VS Code REST Client / Rider / VS). Needs the API on :5001
### and a Postgres per README. Cookies are handled by the client automatically.

@host = http://localhost:5001
@email = dana.whitfield@northline.co
@password = CorrectHorse42

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### 1. Sign up → 201, Set-Cookie tb_refresh, body has accessToken + manager
# @name signup
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Dana Whitfield",
  "organization": "Northline"
}

### 1b. Invalid sign-up → 400 ValidationProblemDetails, keys match form controls
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dana@gmail.com",
  "password": "short",
  "fullName": "D",
  "organization": "N"
}

### 2. Log in → 200 (email is case-insensitive)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2b. Wrong password → 401 with a generic message
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "not-the-password"
}

### 3. Who am I → 200
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Refresh (cookie) → 200, rotated pair; old token is now revoked
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### 4b. Refresh (body form, for non-browser clients) — replaying the OLD token → 401 and revokes the family
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Log out → 204, cookie cleared
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### 6. Rate limit: send this 6+ times within 5 minutes → 429 + Retry-After
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someone@northline.co",
  "password": "wrong"
}
